#: pandastudio_framework/framework_i18n.php:39
msgid "1、图标请从<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://fontawesome.com/icons\">FontAwesome6</a>图标中选择，复制&lt;i&gt;标签即可，如：&lt;i class=&quot;fab fa-apple&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;</li><br>\n2、对边栏的排序仅改变边栏名称与图标。内部的小工具顺序及位置请前往“外观/小工具”进行调整<br>\n3、新增边栏后，若页面未显示“外观/小工具”菜单，请刷新页面后再试。在此处清空边栏（数量为0）将不再显示“外观/小工具”菜单<br>\n注：由于此图标库实时更新，若选择的图标太新，则可能不显示。此时请联系主题开发者更新主题内的图标库<br>\n4、为了更好地让搜索引擎索引，因此边栏的任何数据都不会被搜索引擎。边栏内容被伪装成脚本进行加载。故，边栏中若自定义HTML，请不要再次出现script标签，若需要，则务必将尖括号转义，可写为%3cscript%3e<br>\n左侧尖括号的转移符为：%3c<br>\n右侧尖括号的转移符为：%3e<br>"
msgstr "1. Select an icon from <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://fontawesome.com/icons\">FontAwesome6</a>, then copy the &lt;i&gt; tag, for example: &lt;i class=&quot;fab fa-apple&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;</li><br>\n2. Sorting sidebars only changes sidebar names and icons. Adjust the order and position of widgets under \"Appearance / Widgets\".<br>\n3. After adding a sidebar, refresh the page if the \"Appearance / Widgets\" menu does not appear. Clearing the sidebars here (count 0) removes the \"Appearance / Widgets\" menu.<br>\nNote: This icon library is updated in real time. Very new icons may not be displayed; contact the theme developer to update the icon library bundled with the theme.<br>\n4. To help search engines index the site, sidebar data is hidden from search engines and sidebar content is loaded disguised as a script. If you add custom HTML to a sidebar, do not include another script tag; if necessary, escape angle brackets as %3cscript%3e.<br>\nThe escape code for the left angle bracket is: %3c<br>\nThe escape code for the right angle bracket is: %3e<br>"

